# Reduced hot patch for experiments/trainer-app-offload: ONLY the RLBENCH_NO_HYBRID_ROLLOUT
# layout switch (no hybrid vLLM replicas on the trainer GPUs). Extracted from
# experiments/gpu-host-offload/verl-disagg-memlog.patch; the [gpu-mem] instrumentation,
# the post-sync trainer offload and the sampler sleep cycle are deliberately NOT included,
# so verl performs no offload beyond its own configuration -- every extra move in these runs
# comes from the external controller. Applies to verl release/v0.9.0 @ adc7eefa.
diff --git a/verl/trainer/ppo/v1/trainer_base.py b/verl/trainer/ppo/v1/trainer_base.py
